OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated due to fire at
OL,4,Avillage church
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of houses have been evacuated
OL,7,Fdue to a fire at a church in the
OL,8,Fvillage of Kilburn.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the two-storey
OL,12,Fbuilding on Chapel Street at 00:24 BST
OL,13,Fon Friday. Six appliances and an aerial
OL,14,Fladder platform were sent to the scene.
OL,16,FPolice have closed the road and
OL,17,Fco-ordinated moving residents to
OL,18,Fsafety, but have not confirmed how many
OL,19,Fhomes were affected.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
